 an Culinary Icon
LOCATION:Downtown Library: 4th Floor Program Room\, 343 S Fifth Ave\, Ann 
 Arbor\, MI 48104
GEO:42.2792;-83.7462
DESCRIPTION:Why did an ordinary dish become one of America’s most enduring
  culinary icons? This talk traces the remarkable journey of macaroni and 
